<title>USA: Orange Cty, Fla., health deal ylds 5.7 pct in 2018.</title>
<headline>Orange Cty, Fla., health deal ylds 5.7 pct in 2018.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Monday it tentatively priced $128.8 million Orange County Health Facilities Authority, Fla., hospital bonds, for Orlando Regional Healthcare System, at a top yield of 5.70 percent in 2018.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>Orange County Health Facilities Authority</p>
<p>RE: $128,840,000*</p>
<p>Hospital Revenue Bonds</p>
<p>(Orlando Regional Healthcare System)</p>
<p>Series 1996A</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA	MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 10/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>10/01/2003		4,985M    6.00  %	  4.90</p>
<p>10/01/2004		5,235M    6.00  %	  5.00</p>
<p>10/01/2005		5,500M    6.00  %	  5.10</p>
<p>10/01/2006		5,820M    6.25  %	  5.20</p>
<p>10/01/2007		6,195M    6.25  %	  5.30</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>10/01/2008		6,595M    6.25  %	  5.35</p>
<p>10/01/2009		7,020M    6.25  %	  5.40</p>
<p>10/01/2010		7,475M    6.25  %	  5.45</p>
<p>10/01/2011		7,955M    6.25  %	  5.50</p>
<p>10/01/2012		8,465M    6.25  %	  5.55</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>10/01/2013		9,015M    6.25  %	  5.60</p>
<p>10/01/2016	     30,685M    6.25  %	  5.65</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 107.123)</p>
<p>10/01/2018	     23,895M    6.25  %	  5.70</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 106.837)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Monday, September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on October 16, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>First Southwest Company</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
